  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "3/4 cup butter (cut into large chunks)",
    "2 ounce low-carb dark chocolate (finely chopped)",
    "1/2 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "2 tablespoon instant coffee",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "4 tablespoon unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "1/3 cup almond flour",
    "1/8 teaspoon salt",
    "5 large egg",
    "2/3 cup stevia/erythritol blend (such as Swerve)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Grease a slow cooker with cooking spray. In a small saucepan, melt the butter and unsweetened chocolate over low heat, whisking occasionally. Remove from heat and allow to cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_8888.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, whisk together the heavy cream, instant coffee, and vanilla extract.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_8893.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, combine the cocoa, almond flour, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_8908.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat the eggs with an electric mixer on high speed until slightly thickened. Gradually add the granulated sweetener.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_8942.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat on high for about 5 minutes, or until the mixture is thick and pale yellow.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_8961.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the mixer speed down to low and slowly add into the melted chocolate mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_8982.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the cocoa, almond flour, and salt mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_9052.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the mixer to medium speed and slowly add the cream, coffee, and vanilla mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_9056.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the batter to the prepared slow cooker.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_9083.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a paper towel over the opening of the slow cooker before placing the lid on top to absorb condensation.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_9089.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook on low for 2–3 ½ hours, periodically checking the cake after the 2-hour mark. When done cooking, the center will have a soft soufflé consistency, while the edges will be more cake-like. The center of the cake should be slightly damp on top but resist slightly when pressed. The center of cake needs to reach at least 160F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/DSC_9095.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/slow-cooker-mocha-pudding-cake/#wprm-recipe-52051-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
